+    headroom. Exp6976 must expose at least two real held-out headroom groups, and
+    Exp6977 must supply a certified learned residual, before another selection
+    claim is meaningful. LagONN motivates representing feasibility as a hard
+    state: learned energy ranks only within the feasible set.
+
