+    TASK:
+    Compare likelihood, exact-feasibility-only, PWA-residual-only, and
+    hard-feasible-plus-PWA selection on identical held-out groups with measured
+    headroom. Keep infeasibility as a hard projection, report abstention and
+    cost, and classify any exact-filter-assisted win as circular.
